	  declares. Jamie Malcolm's own source in this repository is BSD-3-Clause
	  (see LICENSE.BSD-3-Clause), but the plugin links GPLv3+ libraries -
	  sc.fiji:TrackMate and sc.fiji:TrackMate-StarDist - and cannot run without
	  them, so the artifact that is distributed and run is GPL-3.0-or-later.
	  `provided` scope is a build-time concern and does not change that.
	  See LICENSING.md.
	-->
